Vendored SQL parser

This component includes software developed by the Apache Software Foundation
(https://www.apache.org/), including Apache DataFusion sqlparser-rs, and by
the sqlparser-rs authors.

The imported source additionally credits Genesis contributors for its MySQL
mode, construct metadata and PostgreSQL emitter extensions. This attribution
is retained from that source; it does not introduce a runtime dependency.

Modified files carry a notice identifying the Darmok changes. The import
retains the parser, AST, dialect implementations, derive macros and test corpus.
